"""\
Full-pipeline IPv4 inventory scanner.\
\
Phases per run:\
  DISCOVERY (round 1)     \'97 masscan (TCP+UDP) or asyncio TCP + ICMP fallback.\
  FULL PORT SCAN          \'97 1-65535 per host (masscan / asyncio).\
  SERVICE CONFIRMATION    \'97 regex on banners; only confirmed services count.\
  ENRICHMENT              \'97 PTR, NetBIOS, mDNS, SSDP, TLS, SNMP, NTP,\
                            DNS recursion, HTTP OPTIONS/headers, traceroute, ARP.\
  BRUTE-FORCE             \'97 after scan, only on confirmed services.\
  DISCOVERY (round 2)     \'97 catch hosts that appeared meanwhile.\
  DISCOVERY (round 3)     \'97 confirmation.\
\
Progress in output/inventory.sqlite3. Results in CSV + JSON.\
